  "description": "A dynaset over \"SELECT ID, Mm, Tx FROM LB WHERE ID = 1\", inside BeginTrans and rolled back: AppendChunk on Mm with no Edit, Errors; Edit, AppendChunk \"abc\" and \"def\" on Mm, FieldSize, GetChunk (0,10), read Value, Update, read Value and FieldSize; Edit, AppendChunk \"zzz\", CancelUpdate, read Value; Edit, AppendChunk on the Text field Tx and read FieldSize and Value, CancelUpdate; Edit, AppendChunk on the Long field ID, Errors, CancelUpdate; Edit, AppendChunk Null, Long 5 and the bytes 65 66 on Mm, FieldSize, read Value, Update, read Value. Asks the state in which AppendChunk is accepted, whether the pending chunk is visible through FieldSize and Value, the fields and argument types it refuses, and what CancelUpdate discards. The fixture copy is opened read-write.",
